        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sanitary landfill facility</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sanitary landfill facility
landfill for untreated municipal solid waste. 1.8 million m3 volume. Construction phase is 5 years;
Synonyms: municipal landfill; 
UUID: 3b5a45d2-6fef-32bc-bb7d-37ddb271581d
infrastructure materials for landfill construction, operation and aftercare. Including access road.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Swiss municipal landfill for biogenic or untreated municipal waste ("reactive organic landfill"). Landfill gas and leachate collection system. Recultivation and monitoring for 150 years after closure.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: data from one literature source 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3b5a45d2-6fef-32bc-bb7d-37ddb271581d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
